#### `app.close()`

Gracefully shut down the Kernova instance. Disconnects all channel adapters and stops the kernel.

```typescript
async close(): Promise<void>
```

```typescript
// Clean shutdown
await app.close();

// Common pattern: shutdown on process exit
process.on('SIGINT', async () => {
  await app.close();
  process.exit(0);
});
```

